| 2 | 265 | 2 | stays open |
| 3 | 34 | 3 | stays open |
| 4 | 9 | 4 | stays open |
| 5 | 2 | 5 | stays open |

At `u_s = 1` the child's effective characteristic data is exactly
`M'_1, …, M'_{s'}` — no further pair can exist — so `s'` is the last effective
